      "description": "[FRE-1072 rebuild note: approximated as count() \u2014 last_value(cap_usd), last_value(running_total), last_value(running_total), last_value(utilization_ratio), last_value(utilization_ratio), last_value(cap_usd). Plots a raw event count per role; none of the original's last_value cap/running-total/utilization-ratio figures were reproduced (Grafana ES top_metrics' settings schema is undocumented \u2014 see plan \u00a70).]",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "es-agent-logs"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "es-agent-logs"
          },
          "query": "event_type: \"budget_counter_snapshot\"",
          "metrics": [
            {
              "type": "count",
              "id": "1"
            }
          ],
          "bucketAggs": [
            {
              "type": "terms",
              "id": "1",
              "field": "role",
              "settings": {
                "size": "10",
                "order": "desc",
                "orderBy": "_count"
              }
            }
